    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot for\u00a0the\u00a0stars,\u00a0let their\u00a0song\u00a0fill everyone's hearts,\u00a0and\u00a0bring\u00a0justice\u00a0long\u00a0overdue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take\u00a0the\u00a0role\u00a0of\u00a0Teacher on the\u00a0idols' journey\u00a0to\u00a0greatness. Guide\u00a0their\u00a0training with four\u00a0different puzzle mini\u00a0games, each testing\u00a0your\u00a0wit\u00a0and\u00a0creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do\u00a0your\u00a0best\u00a0and\u00a0you\u00a0can\u00a0make\u00a0it\u00a0all\u00a0the\u00a0way\u00a0to\u00a0Star-Filled\u00a0Sky\u00a0Festival. There, idols become stars and the\u00a0evil\u00a0Professor\u00a0Kerr\u00a0awaits your revenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition\u00a0to\u00a0the\u00a0main\u00a0story, put the right idols together to experience\u00a0twelve unique storylines told between them.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot for\u00a0the\u00a0stars,\u00a0let their\u00a0song\u00a0fill everyone's hearts,\u00a0and\u00a0bring\u00a0justice\u00a0long\u00a0overdue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take\u00a0the\u00a0role\u00a0of\u00a0Teacher on the\u00a0idols' journey\u00a0to\u00a0greatness. Guide\u00a0their\u00a0training with four\u00a0different puzzle mini\u00a0games, each testing\u00a0your\u00a0wit\u00a0and\u00a0creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do\u00a0your\u00a0best\u00a0and\u00a0you\u00a0can\u00a0make\u00a0it\u00a0all\u00a0the\u00a0way\u00a0to\u00a0Star-Filled\u00a0Sky\u00a0Festival. There, idols become stars and the\u00a0evil\u00a0Professor\u00a0Kerr\u00a0awaits your revenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition\u00a0to\u00a0the\u00a0main\u00a0story, put the right idols together to experience\u00a0twelve unique storylines told between them.</p>",
